 1067                                   ; retry, so it comes back by itself the frame after the drum ends. That is
 1068                                   ; the reference player's priority, where the drum overrides the volume.
 1069  000006BE  7401                           moveq   #1,d2                   ; (d4 still holds the OLD code)
