  123                                   
  124                                   ; ST4_resume: a0/a1/d0/d1/d2 = state and d3.w = this call's budget.
  125                                   ; Continuing calls emit d3 bytes; the final call may be shorter. The caller
  126                                   ; knows the final span from O; [old a1 .. new a1) is fresh output.
